---
layout: base
eleventyNavigation:
  key: Home
  order: 1
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
site_value: Navigate the complexities of enterprise identity management. We offer guidance and best practices to simplify implementation and help you build secure, scalable identity solutions for your applications, avoiding common pitfalls along the way. Discover resources for developers, created by Okta developer and industry experts. Our aim is to demystify and clarify identity management for you.
topics:
  title: Explore enterprise identity concepts
  subtitle: Maturing software applications have unique identity management solution needs. Explore concepts that elevate applications into enterprise-level software.
foundations:
  title: Revisit identity foundations
  subtitle: Build upon identity fundamentals to scale your app for enterprise needs.
  resources:
    - { title: Why is identity important?, link: https://stackoverflow.blog/2020/12/21/how-digital-identity-protects-your-software/ }
    - { title: What is enterprise identity?, link: https://www.linkedin.com/pulse/what-main-differences-between-employeepartner-iam-vs-customer-seal }
    - { title: Terminology and vocabulary overview, link: https://developer.okta.com/docs/concepts/iam-overview-iam-terminology/ }
    - { title: OAuth and OIDC, link: https://developer.okta.com/blog/2019/10/21/illustrated-guide-to-oauth-and-oidc }
---

<div class="space-y-16">
  <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto space-y-5">
    <h1 class="text-5xl sm:text-6xl leading-[1.15] text-sii-light-header dark:text-sii-dark-header">{{meta.title}}</h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-sii-light-text dark:text-sii-dark-text">{{site_value}}</p>

    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 border border-sii-border dark:border-sii-dark-border rounded-full px-4 py-3 bg-sii-light-background dark:bg-sii-dark-background">
      {% feather "search", { "stroke-width": 1.5, width: 18, "class": "text-sii-light-text dark:text-sii-dark-text shrink-0" } %}
      <span class="text-sm text-sii-light-text dark:text-sii-dark-text text-left grow">Search identity concepts, standards, and guides&hellip;</span>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2">
      {%- for entry in collections.all | eleventyNavigation | sort(attribute='data.order') %}
        {%- if entry.url != "/" -%}
      <a href="{{ entry.url }}" class="bg-sii-light-muted dark:bg-sii-dark-muted text-sii-light-header dark:text-sii-dark-header rounded-full px-3 py-1.5 text-sm transition-colors duration-200 hover:bg-sii-light-accent">{{ entry.title }}</a>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>

  <div id="identity-topics">
    {% set topics = topics %}
    {% include "_topics.njk" %}
  </div>

  <section class="space-y-8">
  <div class="space-y-4">
    <h2 class="text-sii-light-header dark:text-sii-dark-header text-5xl">{{ foundations.title }}</h2>
    <p class="text-lg">{{ foundations.subtitle }}</p>
  </div>
  <div class="mt-2 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 xl:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
    {%- for item in foundations.resources -%}
    <div class="h-full w-full p-5 flex flex-col gap-4 bg-sii-light-background border border-sii-border rounded-lg transition-all duration-200 hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-0.5 dark:bg-sii-dark-background dark:border-sii-dark-border">
      <div class="self-start bg-sii-primary p-2.5 rounded-full">
        {% feather "lock", { "stroke": "#fbfbfb" } %}
      </div>
      <a href="{{item.link}}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="grow rounded-sm focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-sii-primary">
        <h3 class="text-sii-light-header dark:text-sii-dark-header text-xl leading-snug">{{item.title}}</h3>
      </a>
      <a href="{{item.link}}" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 border border-sii-border dark:border-sii-dark-border text-sii-light-header dark:text-sii-dark-header rounded-full px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium transition-colors duration-200 hover:border-sii-primary hover:text-sii-primary focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-sii-primary mt-auto w-fit">
        Learn more {% feather "external-link", {"stroke-width": 1.5, width: 14} %}
      </a>
    </div>
  {%- endfor -%}
  </div>
</section>
</div>

